          },
          "font-size": {
            "type": "float",
            "value": 19
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "TO FLOAT3\n\nThe To Float3 node converts floats, float2’s and integers to the float 3 type. \nIt will use the incoming value for all  components of the float3.\nConverting from float2 to float3 will make the final component 0.\n\nFor example:  A float(5.3) into the To Float3 node will produce a float3(5.3, 5.3, 5.3).\n\nWire will almost always implicitly convert to float3 for you, making this node very niche."
          }
        },
