          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "EXAMPLE\n\nIn this example we are converting the Float In into a Float3 which in turn will control the X, Y an Z phase of the Fractal noise.\n\nNote that wire will implicitly convert the Float In to Float 3 when you directly connect the Float In to the Phase offset. \nThe To Float3 node is only here for demonstration purposes."
          }
        },
